## The Gallery

::bg{location="skerry_gallery" time="day"}
::sfx{sound="wind_howl"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The gallery runs round the outside of the lantern, a ledge of iron plate with a rail at waist height.
@narrator{code="0020"}: On the seaward side, the rail simply stops.
@inspector{code="0010" mono}: If he came out here to wipe the glass, in that wind, in the dark...
@inspector{code="0020" mono,when="holds('placedBy', ['logbook', 'elias', 'gallery', 'midnight'])"}: Eleven-forty. His own hand. He was coming out here.
